gth":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Drama","Romance","Comedy"],"id":14884,"type":"SERIES","title":"The Flower of Evil","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk59/seasons/85e4b486-8af8-4b2d-b795-ca374214d6c4.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk48/seasons/caddaf9a-7a65-40c3-a7a3-2aa1dd7091a3.jpg","likes":1954,"dislikes":29,"views":165801,"release_date":"1594771200000","season_number":1,"description":"The Plan is a business that turns women into perfect ladies for a man, which is managed by Mr. Robert. He calls these women the \"Ideal Wife\". Chollada is from a middle-class family who became a perfect and educated lady by The Plan. She was considered to be a great product from the company. Mr. Robert thinks she's perfect for Kasidit and tries to invite him for this service many times. Kasidit starts to think of this as a fun game, so he accepts it and meets Chollada. It's no longer a game for him when he falls in love with her, but he doesn't know if she truly likes him or if it's a set up by The Plan.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8.5}],"value":8.5,"age":"PG-13"},"current_season_id":1937,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}